# custom.toml is the from-scratch profile generated by generate-config.{sh,py}
# from DEFAULT_INDEX_URL + EXTRA_INDEX_URLS. It must never be committed: "custom"
# is an EXPLICIT choice (not inferred from a missing file), and a checked-in
# custom.toml would be silently ignored (gradle and the scripts always build
# custom from scratch), so committing it only causes confusion. Keep it ignored.
custom.toml
